<title>UK: BOT allots 3.4 billion stg in money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOT allots 3.4 billion stg in money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted a total of 3.4 billion stg in repo and secured loan facilities at 5-31/32 percent.</p>
<p>It is allotting 112 million stg on the repos maturing on December 19, 20 and 23 and 3.288 billion stg on repos maturing on January 9, 10 and 13.</p>
<p>The total allotted represented around 28 percent of the amounts applied for, which for were 399 million stg on the December repos and 11.729 billion on the January repos.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
